-- `on_hand(sku)`, `item(sku)`, `skus()`, `history(sku=None)`.
+- `reserve(sku, quantity, ref)` holds units for an order; `release(ref)` drops everything the order holds and
+  returns the units freed. `available(sku)` is the stock on hand that no order holds, and `ship` never takes more
+  than that.
+- `on_hand(sku)`, `reserved(sku)`, `item(sku)`, `skus()`, `history(sku=None)`, `reservations()`.
 - Quantities are positive whole numbers; anything else raises `ValueError`. An unknown SKU raises `UnknownSku`.
 
